• Relevant experience in both project management and digital marketing;

• Experience on the agency side;

• Have experience and ambition to manage digital marketing projects within the creative field (content creation, organic social media, design, affiliate marketing);

• Experience and/or affinity with project management tools such as Asana, Trello, Jira;

• Have experience with A-brands and their digital performance issues;

• Located and available to start working either from our offices in Amsterdam or Rotterdam;

• Speak fluent Dutch and English.

